的好友\",\"personality\":\"细心、可靠、善于照顾人\",\"speakingStyle\":\"语气平和亲切，常带鼓励性词汇\",\"background\":\"摄影爱好者，热爱户外露营\",\"rules\":[]}}],\"relationships\":[{\"fromActorId\":\"actor_lan\",\"toActorId\":\"actor_cheng\",\"description\":\"多年好友兼露营搭档，彼此非常信任\"},{\"fromActorId\":\"actor_cheng\",\"toActorId\":\"actor_lan\",\"description\":\"依赖岚的沉稳规划，常为岚带来欢乐与惊喜\"}],\"stages\":[{\"id\":\"stage_1\",\"title\":\"布置营地\",\"order\":1,\"actorIds\":[\"actor_lan\",\"actor_cheng\"],\"location\":\"海边营地沙滩\",\"instruction\":\"分工布置帐篷和灯串\",\"requiredBeats\":[{\"id\":\"beat_tent\",\"text\":\"完成帐篷与灯串的架设\",\"actorIds\":[\"actor_lan\",\"actor_cheng\"]}],\"locked\":false,\"endCondition\":\"营地设施布置完毕\"},{\"id\":\"stage_2\",\"title\":\"晚餐与合照\",\"order\":2,\"actorIds\":[\"actor_lan\",\"actor_cheng\"],\"location\":\"营地长桌与篝火旁\",\"instruction\":\"共进晚餐并拍照留念\",\"requiredBeats\":[{\"id\":\"beat_photo\",\"text\":\"拍摄营地合照与记录视频\",\"actorIds\":[\"actor_lan\",\"actor_cheng\"]}],\"locked\":true,\"endCondition\":\"合照完成并发布朋友圈\"},{\"id\":\"stage_rework_afterparty\",\"title\":\"散场后的分享\",\"order\":3,\"actorIds\":[\"actor_lan\",\"actor_cheng\",\"actor_rework_guest\"],\"location\":\"营地长桌与篝火旁\",\"instruction\":\"大家回到群里分享照片，互相道别。\",\"requiredBeats\":[],\"locked\":true,\"endCondition\":\"合照完成并发布朋友圈\"}],\"conversations\":[{\"id\":\"group_main\",\"kind\":\"group\",\"title\":\"海边营地小分队\",\"memberActorIds\":[\"actor_lan\",\"actor_cheng\"]}],\"messages\":[{\"id\":\"msg_1\",\"conversationId\":\"group_main\",\"stageId\":\"stage_1\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"speakerActorId\":\"actor_lan\",\"text\":\"海风好舒服，澄，我们先把桌椅和灯串拉好。\",\"mediaSlotIds\":[],\"storyOrder\":10,\"storyTimeLabel\":\"16:30\"},{\"id\":\"msg_2\",\"conversationId\":\"group_main\",\"stageId\":\"stage_1\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"speakerActorId\":\"actor_cheng\",\"text\":\"收到！灯串我已经挂在帐篷前了，等天黑就会亮起来！✨\",\"mediaSlotIds\":[],\"storyOrder\":20,\"storyTimeLabel\":\"16:35\"},{\"id\":\"msg_photo\",\"conversationId\":\"group_main\",\"stageId\":\"stage_2\",\"kind\":\"message\",\"speakerActorId\":\"acto